      "about": "“Transforming visions into reality through strategic leadership and innovative thinking.”\n\nAs a pragmatic leader & professional with over 21+ years of experience in the telecom industry, I have a proven track record of driving operational excellence and fostering a culture of innovation. At Wipro, I lead a dynamic team of Americas region - Intelligent service fulfilment with with portfolio of 15 Mn $, steering the function towards strong delivery with sustainable growth and market leadership.\n\nKey Achievements:\n•\tSpearheaded a function-wide digital transformation initiative, resulting in a 10% increase in operational efficiency.\n•\tLed multiple business transitions & projects successfully with multiple industry and client accolades resulting in business growth of 12%.\n•\tImplemented a leadership development program that reduced employee turnover by 20%.\n•\tImplemented Exx Programs to boost employee experience by 2% QoQ in last 2 FYs.\n\nLeadership Style: I believe in empowering my team through trust, transparency, and continuous learning. My approach is centered on fostering collaboration, encouraging creative problem-solving, and driving a shared vision.\n\nVision and Goals: My goal is to continue pushing the boundaries of innovation while maintaining a strong focus on customer satisfaction and operational excellence. I am passionate about leveraging technology to create solutions that make a meaningful impact on society.\n\nLet’s connect! I am always open to discussing new ideas, exploring collaboration opportunities, and connecting with like-minded professionals.",
